[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:April Fools' Day]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:11.32]What was the joke? | 那个玩笑是什么？
[00:15.08]'To end our special news bulletin,' | “在我们结束特别新闻节目之前，”
[00:18.79]said the voice of the television announcer, 'we're going over to the macaroni fields of Calabria. | 电视播音员说，“我们现在到卡拉布利亚的通心粉田里去。
[00:28.34]Macaroni has been grown in this area for over six hundred years. | 通心粉在这个地区已经种植了600多年了。
[00:34.57]Two of the leading growers Giuseppe Moldova and Riccardo Brabante, | 两个主要的种植者朱塞皮·莫尔道瓦和里卡多·布拉班特
[00:41.31]tell me that they have been expecting a splendid crop this year and harvesting has begun earlier than usual. | 告诉我，他们一直期待着今年获得一个大丰收，收割工作比往年开始得还要早。
[00:50.79]Here you can see two workers who, between them, | 大家现在可以看到两位工人，
[00:55.37]have just finished cutting three cartloads of golden brown macaroni stalks. | 他们协力刚刚割完3车金黄色的通心粉梗。
[01:02.84]The whole village has been working day and night gathering and threshing this year's crop before the September rains. | 全村人日夜劳作，赶在9月的雨季之前把今年的庄稼收割上来并脱粒。
[01:13.34]On the right, you can see Mrs. Brabante herself. | 在右边，大家可以看到布拉班特太太本人，
[01:18.47]She has been helping her husband for thirty years now. | 她已经帮丈夫干了30年了。
[01:23.09]Mrs. Brabante is talking to the manager of the local factory where the crop is processed. | 布拉班特太太正在和当地通心粉加工厂的经理交谈。
[01:30.39]This last scene shows you what will happen at the end of the harvest: | 这最后一个镜头向您展示了收获之后将要发生的事情：
[01:36.23]the famous Calabrian macaroni-eating competition! | 著名的卡拉布利亚吃通心粉大赛！
[01:41.42]Signor Fratelli, the present champion, has won it every year since 1991. | 目前的冠军弗拉特里先生，自1991年以来年年获胜。
[01:49.69]And that ends our special bulletin for today, Thursday, April 1st. | 今天的特别新闻节目到此结束，今天是4月1日，星期四。
[01:56.25]We're now going back to the studio.' | 现在我们回到电视演播室。”
